cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CoxeterViewer5D in research, teaching, or a public demo, please cite the software release."
type: software
title: "CoxeterViewer5D"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-08-01"
abstract: "Offline-capable research and teaching viewer for finite pieces of Coxeter groups: Davis complex neighborhoods, Y_Gamma, the defining graph Gamma, hyperbolic projections, quotient-style complexes, generator-uniform cochains, JNW legal-system diagnostics, and certified compact Coxeter examples."
authors:
  - name: "CoxeterViewer5D contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/hgfjh/CoxeterViewer5D"
url: "https://github.com/hgfjh/CoxeterViewer5D/releases/tag/v0.2.0"
license: "Apache-2.0"
keywords:
  - "Coxeter groups"
  - "Davis complex"
  - "Cayley graph"
  - "hyperbolic reflection groups"
  - "geometric topology"
  - "mathematical visualization"
  - "Y_Gamma"
